#: src/main.ui:60
msgid "Face models"
msgstr "Yuz modellari"

#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello bilan taqqoslanadigan yuzingiz suratlari. Har xil yoritishda "
"yozilgan kamida ikkitasini saqlang."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Quyidagilar uchun saqlangan modellar ko'rsatilmoqda:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Faqat bitta yuz modeli ro‘yxatga olingan. Ko‘zoynak, soqolning o‘zgarishi "
"yoki boshqa yorug‘lik kamera yuzingizni qanday ko‘rishini o‘zgartiradi, "
"shuning uchun bitta model muvaffaqiyatsiz bo‘lishi mumkin (masalan, "
"kechqurun chiroq yorug‘ida). Qulfni ochish ishonchli bo‘lib qolishi uchun "
"ko‘zoynakli yoki ko‘zoynaksiz, boshqa ko‘rinishingizda yoki boshqa "
"yorug‘likda ikkinchi model qo‘shing."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ikkinchi modelni qo'shing"

#: src/main.ui:227
msgid "Models"
msgstr "Modellar"

#: src/main.ui:261
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Kamera"

#: src/main.ui:276
msgid ""
"The camera Ubuntu Hello uses to look for your face, with a live preview."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kamerasi jonli koʻrish bilan yuzingizni qidirish uchun "
"foydalanadi."

#: src/main.ui:300
msgid "Camera ID:"
msgstr "Kamera identifikatori:"

#: src/main.ui:315
msgid "Real resolution:"
msgstr "Haqiqiy ruxsat:"

#: src/main.ui:331
msgid "Used resolution:"
msgstr "Ishlatilgan ruxsat:"

#: src/main.ui:347
msgid "Recorder:"
msgstr "Yozuvchi:"

#: src/main.ui:393
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Videotasvir"

#: src/main.ui:430 src/main.ui:583
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Bildirishnomalar"

#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello yuzingizni qidirayotganda ish stoli bildirishnomasi chiqadi va "
"natijani xabar qiladi. Muvaffaqiyatsiz urinishlar bildirishnomalar "
"ro'yxatida qoladi."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Bildirishnomalarni ko'rsatish"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Har bir yuzni tekshirishga urinish uchun bitta karta, natija bilan "
"yangilanadi."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Bildirishnoma tovushlari"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Taniqli yoki muvaffaqiyatsiz urinish uchun tizim ovozini o'ynang."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostikani o'z ichiga oladi"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Har bir kartaga model, aniqlik va chegara, ramkalar, kamera va vaqtni "
"qo'shing. Muammo haqida xabar berishda foydalidir."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Xavfsizlik"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Yuzingiz qanchalik aniq mos kelishi kerakligi va Ubuntu Hello sizdan "
"haqiqatan ham shu yerda ekaningizni tasdiqlashni so‘rash-so‘ramasligi."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Yuz mosligining qat’iyligi"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Tez"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Balanslangan"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Xavfsiz"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Tasdiqlash uchun bosh irg‘ashni so‘rash"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Yuzingiz tanilgandan so‘ng bildirishnoma sizdan bosh irg‘ashni so‘raydi. "
"Kameraga tutilgan surat bosh irg‘ay olmaydi."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Kalitlar / KWallet Avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Kirish kalitini avtomatik ravishda ochish uchun yuz autentifikatsiyasini "
"yoqing yoki tizimga kirishda KWallet. Bu mavjud bo'lganda TPM da muhrlangan "
"yoki faqat root uchun asosiy kalit yordamida AES-256-GCM bilan shifrlangan "
"parolingizni xavfsiz saqlaydi. Ish stolingizga qarab pam_gnome_keyring yoki "
"pam_kwallet5 uchun yuzni autentifikatsiya qilish PAM_AUTHTOK oʻrnatiladi."

