#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "Haqida"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello ga xush kelibsiz"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Sozlash tugallandi!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Biz tugatdik! Ubuntu Hello hozir ushbu kompyuterda faol. Autentifikatsiya "
"qilish uchun odatda parolingizni kiritishingiz kerak bo'lgan hamma narsani "
"bajarishga harakat qiling, masalan, sudo bilan buyruqni bajarish. Agar siz "
"kalitlarni avtomatik ochish funksiyasini yoqsangiz, login kaliti yoki "
"KWallet ham tizimga kirganingizda avtomatik tarzda ochiladi.\n"
"\n"
"Keyinchalik kengaytirilgan sozlamalarni oʻzgartirish yoki qoʻshimcha "
"modellar qoʻshish uchun Ubuntu Hello Konfiguratorni ochishingiz mumkin. "
"Ushbu oynani yopish va Ubuntu Hello Konfiguratorni ochish uchun quyidagi "
"Finish tugmasini bosing."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Aniqlik siyosatini o'rnatish"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Burchaklar, masofa va boshqa omillarning o'zgarishi tufayli yuz mosligi hech "
"qachon saqlangan yuz modeli bilan bir xil bo'lmaydi. Ushbu sahifada siz "
"Ubuntu Hello qanchalik qat'iy bo'lishini belgilashingiz mumkin."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"Eng yumshoq moslik va eng tez kirish imkoni. Qat’iylikdan ko‘ra qulaylik "
"muhimroq bo‘lsa, shuni tanlang."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"Qat’iy moslik, ammo tizimga baribir tez kirasiz. Keskin burchakdan yoki "
"uzoqroqdan sizni tanimasligi mumkin."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"Eng qat’iy moslik, tizimga kirishda qo‘shimcha qadamsiz. Tavsiya etiladi."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Hozircha o'tkazib yuboring"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Keyinroq Sozlamalar orqali yoki sudo ubuntu-hello add orqali boshqa yuz "
"modellarini qo‘shishingiz mumkin"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Veb-kamera sozlanmoqda"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Infraqizil emitent miltillayaptimi?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Siz tanlagan kameraga qarang: infraqizil kamera Ubuntu Hello sinovdan "
"o'tkazayotganda miltillovchi kichik chiroqni ko'rsatadi. Bu bizga qorong'uda "
"sizning yuzingizni ko'rishi mumkinligini aytadi."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Ha, miltillaydi"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Yo'q, hech narsa porlamaydi"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tizimingizda mavjud kameralarni avtomatik ravishda qidiradi, "
"shuning uchun veb-kamerangiz ulanganligiga ishonch hosil qiling. "
"Aniqlangandan so'ng foydalanish mumkin bo'lgan veb-kameralar ro'yxati "
"ko'rsatiladi. Foydalanmoqchi bo'lgan birini tanlang va \"Keyingi\" tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Veb-kameralaringiz tekshirilmoqda, kuting..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar fayllari yuklab olinmoqda"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello sizni tanib olishi uchun oldindan oʻrgatilgan uchta yuzni "
"tanish maʼlumotlar toʻplami kerak, ular hozir yuklab olinadi. Quyida yuklab "
"olish jarayonini ko'rishingiz mumkin."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Yuklash boshlanmoqda..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello ga xush kelibsiz!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versiya"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu sehrgar sizni sozlash jarayoni bo'ylab ko'rsatib beradi va siz uchun "
"avtomatik ravishda Ubuntu Hello sozlaydi. Davom etish uchun keyingi "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tizimga kirganingizdan soʻng parol soʻrovlarini oldini olgan "
"holda, yuz autentifikatsiyasi yordamida login kalitingizni avtomatik "
"ravishda yoki KWallet qulfini ochishi mumkin."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Avtomatik kalitlash/KWallet qulfdan chiqarishni yoqing"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Parolni tasdiqlang"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Orqaga"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Oʻrnatishni yakunlang"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Keyingisi"

